        "guide": "The middle stage of Geodude's line, a four-armed, boulder-like Rock and Ground Pokémon. It rolls down mountains at high speed and eats rocks, especially moss-covered ones. It evolves into Golem when traded, and its Alolan form is a Rock and Electric type.",
